<title>SAN MARINO: TENNIS-SAN MARINO MEN'S TOURNAMENT RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-SAN MARINO MEN'S TOURNAMENT RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>SAN MARINO 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>First round results of the</p>
<p>$300,000 San Marino men's clay court tournament on Tuesday</p>
<p>(prefix denotes seeding):</p>
<p>1-Felix Mantilla (Spain) beat Richard Fromberg (Australia) 6-4</p>
<p>4-6 7-6 (7-5)</p>
<p>Hendrik Dreekmann (Germany) beat Nicolas Lapentti (Ecuador) 3-6</p>
<p>6-3 6-2</p>
<p>6-Dominic Hrbaty (Slovakia) beat Marcelo Charpentier</p>
<p>(Argentina) 7-6 (7-5) 6-2</p>
<p>Andrei Pavel (Romania) beat Jens Knippschild (Germany) 6-3 6-1</p>
<p>8-Christian Ruud (Norway) beat Jacobo Diaz (Spain) 6-2 6-0</p>
<p>Davide Sanguinetti (Italy) beat Omar Camporese (Italy) 6-1 7-5</p>
<p>Adrian Voinea (Romania) beat 3-Albert Portas (Spain) 3-6 6-4</p>
<p>6-0</p>
<p>Hernan Gumy (Argentina) beat Dinu Pescariu (Romania) 3-6 6-3</p>
<p>7-6 (7-4)</p>
<p>Renzo Ferlan (Italy) beat Franco Squillari (Argentina) 6-2 7-6</p>
<p>(7-4)</p>
<p>Magnus Gustaffson (Sweden) beat Marcelo Filippini (Uruguay) 6-2</p>
<p>6-4</p>
<p>4-Javier Sanchez (Spain) beat Marzio Martelli (Italy) 6-3 6-3  </p>
<p>Carlos Costa (Spain) beat 5-Hicham Arazi (Morocco) 6-4 6-3</p>
</text>
